    ("K.3 Contract checklist", "Before releasing additional clients, document field types, blank-input response, tone allow-list, maximum content length, timeout, provider failure mapping, and whether the API response stays raw text or becomes a JSON object. Keep both clients and examples synchronized when the contract changes.")
